Third-party components in this model pack

plate_yolox_tiny_640.onnx
-------------------------
Produced by the open-lpr contributors. Architecture from YOLOX (Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX), under Apache-2.0. The model was pretrained on COCO and fine-tuned on an annotated license-plate corpus plus community-contributed images pseudo-labelled by a teacher model.

The publisher states that some community-contributed photos containing real plates, faces, and vehicles were uploaded without consent obtained. Those source images are not published or included here. Ultralytics YOLO weights are not used or redistributed.
